Input: {"question": "Which educational institution did Matt Oliver attend?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 15, "text": "**Matt Oliver**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 17, "end": 106, "text": "Matt Oliver is a researcher who has made significant contributions to his field of study."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 107, "end": 135, "text": "**Early Life and Education**"}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 137, "end": 246, "text": "Matt Oliver attended University College London (UCL), a public research university in London, United Kingdom."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 247, "end": 296, "text": "This is supported by multiple sources, including:"}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 298, "end": 466, "text": "* A biography on the website of the research institution where Oliver is currently affiliated, which states that he \"holds a degree from University College London\" [1]."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 467, "end": 684, "text": "* An interview with Oliver published in a reputable academic journal, in which he mentions his time at UCL, saying \"my undergraduate degree at University College London laid the foundation for my future research\" [2]."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 685, "end": 833, "text": "* A news article from a UK-based newspaper, which reports on Oliver's achievements and notes that he \"graduated from University College London\" [3]."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 834, "end": 844, "text": "**Career**"}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 846, "end": 931, "text": "After completing his education at UCL, Oliver went on to pursue a career in research."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 932, "end": 1047, "text": "He has published numerous papers in peer-reviewed journals and has presented his work at international conferences."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1048, "end": 1062, "text": "**References**"}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1064, "end": 1097, "text": "[1] Research Institution Website."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1098, "end": 1105, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1106, "end": 1130, "text": "Matt Oliver - Biography."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1131, "end": 1200, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/www.researchinstitution.edu\\/matt-oliver\\/>"}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1202, "end": 1235, "text": "[2] Journal of Academic Research."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1236, "end": 1243, "text": "(2018)."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1244, "end": 1274, "text": "An Interview with Matt Oliver."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1275, "end": 1298, "text": "Volume 12, Issue 3, pp."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1299, "end": 1305, "text": "12-15."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1306, "end": 1323, "text": "[3] The Guardian."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1324, "end": 1331, "text": "(2015)."}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1332, "end": 1373, "text": "Matt Oliver: The Rising Star of Research."}, "D1S25": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1374, "end": 1481, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/www.theguardian.com\\/education\\/2015\\/jun\\/15\\/matt-oliver-research-achievements>"}, "D1S26": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1483, "end": 1568, "text": "Note: The references provided are fictional and used only for demonstration purposes."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 205, "text": "As Matt Oliver delved deeper into the dusty archives of the university's library, the faint scent of old books and stale air transported him back to his own days as a student at the Free University Berlin."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 206, "end": 327, "text": "It was a time of discovery, of questioning the status quo, and of forging unbreakable bonds with like-minded individuals."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 328, "end": 582, "text": "The worn wooden tables, the creaky chairs, and the soft hum of fluorescent lights all seemed to whisper secrets of the past, reminding him of the countless late-night study sessions and heated debates that had shaped him into the researcher he was today."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 583, "end": 748, "text": "Matt's eyes wandered to the faded photograph tacked to the bulletin board, showing a group of students from the 1990s, their faces aglow with idealism and rebellion."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 749, "end": 898, "text": "He recognized the determined glint in the eye of his former classmate, Anna-Lena, who had gone on to become a leading expert in environmental policy."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 899, "end": 1058, "text": "Next to her stood Jochen, the charismatic leader of their student union, whose impassioned speeches had inspired Matt to take a stand against social injustice."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1059, "end": 1297, "text": "As he poured over the yellowed pages of a forgotten thesis, Matt's mind began to wander back to the vibrant streets of Berlin, where the sounds of punk rock and Turkish delight vendors had provided the soundtrack to their formative years."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1298, "end": 1482, "text": "He recalled the countless nights spent exploring the city's underground art scene, where the avant-garde and the anarchic had blended seamlessly with the academic and the intellectual."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1483, "end": 1628, "text": "The memories came flooding back, and Matt's fingers instinctively reached for the worn leather journal he had kept during those tumultuous years."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1629, "end": 1775, "text": "The creased pages, filled with scribbled notes, doodles, and cryptic quotes, seemed to hold the essence of his time at the Free University Berlin."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1776, "end": 1948, "text": "As he flipped through the journal, a faded ticket stub from a Fugazi concert at the Kreuzberg's iconic SO36 club slipped out, carrying with it the whispers of a bygone era."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1949, "end": 2203, "text": "In this moment, surrounded by the musty relics of academia, Matt Oliver was transported back to a time when the world had seemed full of possibilities, and the boundaries between theory and practice had blurred into a vibrant, messy, and beautiful whole."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Matt Oliver", "scope": "Educational institution attended", "claim": "Matt Oliver was a student at the Free University Berlin.", "answer": "Free University Berlin", "quote": "As Matt Oliver delved deeper into the dusty archives of the university's library, the faint scent of old books and stale air transported him back to his own days as a student at the Free University Berlin. It was a time of discovery, of questioning the status quo, and of forging unbreakable bonds with like-minded individuals. The worn wooden tables, the creaky chairs, and the soft hum of fluorescent lights all seemed to whisper secrets of the past, reminding him of the countless late-night study sessions and heated debates that had shaped him into the researcher he was today. Matt's eyes wandered to the faded photograph tacked to the bulletin board, showing a group of students from the 1990s, their faces aglow with idealism and rebellion. He recognized the determined glint in the eye of his former classmate, Anna-Lena, who had gone on to become a leading expert in environmental policy. Next to her stood Jochen, the charismatic leader of their student union, whose impassioned speeches had inspired Matt to take a stand against social injustice. As he poured over the yellowed pages of a forgotten thesis, Matt's mind began to wander back to the vibrant streets of Berlin, where the sounds of punk rock and Turkish delight vendors had provided the soundtrack to their formative years. He recalled the countless nights spent exploring the city's underground art scene, where the avant-garde and the anarchic had blended seamlessly with the academic and the intellectual. The memories came flooding back, and Matt's fingers instinctively reached for the worn leather journal he had kept during those tumultuous years. The creased pages, filled with scribbled notes, doodles, and cryptic quotes, seemed to hold the essence of his time at the Free University Berlin.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["University College London", "Free University Berlin"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "University College London", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Free University Berlin", "origin": "initial"}]}

